# Force LF line endings on checkout for all text files, regardless of platform.
# Motivation: Prettier default endOfLine="lf" fails npm run format:check on
# Windows checkouts when core.autocrlf=true (CRLF in working tree). Aligning
# working tree with repo eliminates the drift.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: leave them alone.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.svg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
